---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout lang="en" title="About Stroomlijnen Cultuur" activeNav="/over-ons" bodyClass="page-over-ons">
<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About us</h1>
      <p class="intro-tekst">Stroomlijnen grew out of life on the road. Touring Dutch theatres with different productions every day showed us where crews ran into trouble and what venues needed. We set up a dedicated company to build a charging system that would work at the stage door.</p>
      <p class="intro-tekst">We want touring to remain possible as the sector moves to electric vehicles. That’s why we keep equipment prices low and offer a dedicated charging rate for cultural organisations.</p>
      <p class="intro-tekst">Charging also supports the wider sector. Through the Cultuurfonds, proceeds can reach artists and organisations that need financial support during the transition.</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <p class="what-kicker">Team</p>
      <h2>Meet Stroomlijnen</h2>
      <p class="team-intro">Our team brings together theatre logistics, electrical hardware, software and the hands-on work of installing chargers at venues.</p>
      <div class="team-grid">
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-photo"><img src="/team-ignacio.webp" alt="Ignacio Michelena" /></div>
          <h3>Ignacio Michelena</h3>
          <span class="team-role">CEO and Technical Director</span>
          <p>Ignacio builds and operates the platform. His work covers hardware sourcing, IT infrastructure and the open-source software for charging and energy management.</p>
          <div class="team-social">
            <a href="mailto:ignacio@stroomlijnen.nl">ignacio@stroomlijnen.nl</a><br>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/imichelena" target="_blank">LinkedIn →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-photo"><img src="/team-jacco.webp" alt="Jacco Patist" /></div>
          <h3>Jacco Patist</h3>
          <span class="team-role">Commercial Director</span>
          <p>Jacco brings 30 years of theatre production experience to partnerships and customer relations. He owns Lichtwerk B.V., where we installed our first pilot charger.</p>
          <div class="team-social">
            <a href="mailto:jacco@stroomlijnen.nl">jacco@stroomlijnen.nl</a><br>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jacco-patist-81629897" target="_blank">LinkedIn →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="two-col">
        <div class="sidebar-stat">
          <h3>30 years in the sector</h3>
          <p>Our backgrounds are in event power, theatre technology and IT infrastructure. We know how a theatre works, from the dressing rooms to the loading dock.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sidebar-stat">
          <h3>Spare parts stocked in Amsterdam</h3>
          <p>Our factory-trained service team keeps power modules, touchscreens and connectors in Amsterdam so replacements can go straight to a venue.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <p class="what-kicker">Supporting the arts</p>
      <h2>ERE proceeds for the Cultuurfonds</h2>
      <div class="two-col">
        <div>
          <p>In the Netherlands, eligible electricity supplied to road transport can earn emission reduction units (EREs) when the delivery is registered.</p>
          <p>These units can be sold. Stroomlijnen directs the proceeds back into the cultural sector.</p>
          <p>All ERE proceeds from Stroomlijnen locations go to the Cultuurfonds to support projects and artists in music and theatre.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="logo-figure">
          <img src="/images/cultuurfonds-logo-donkerbruin.png" alt="Cultuurfonds" width="1047" height="403" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container cta-block">
      <h2>Would you like to talk?</h2>
      <a href="https://stroomlijnen.nl/en/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Get in touch →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
